<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>{{> layout/head-meta}}<title>좋아요한 행사 | Busan Play</title>{{> layout/favorite-assets}}</head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
{{> layout/account-style}}
{{> layout/personal-account-style}}
<main class="personal-account-page favorites-page">
    <div class="account-layout">
        {{> layout/account-nav}}
        <section class="account-content" data-favorites-page>
            <header class="account-heading"><div><p class="account-location">마이페이지 / 내 활동</p><h1>좋아요한 행사</h1><p class="account-description">다음에 가보고 싶은 부산의 경험을 모아두세요.</p></div><a class="account-button account-button--secondary" href="/events/list">행사 둘러보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
            <div class="account-result-line favorites-result"><span role="status">저장한 행사 <strong data-favorite-total>{{favoriteTotal}}</strong>개</span><span>하트를 누르면 목록에서 제외됩니다.</span></div>
            <div class="account-favorites-grid">
                {{#favorites}}{{#event}}
                <article class="favorite-item account-favorite-card" data-favorite-item>
                    <div class="favorite-card-heading"><span class="account-category">{{#categoryName}}{{categoryName}}{{/categoryName}}{{^categoryName}}행사{{/categoryName}}</span><span class="account-event-status" data-favorite-event-status>{{status}}</span></div>
                    <h2><a href="/event/{{id}}">{{title}}</a></h2>
                    <p class="favorite-card-summary">{{summary}}</p>
                    <a class="favorite-card-link" href="/event/{{id}}">일정과 상세 정보 확인 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                    {{> layout/favorite-button}}
                </article>
                {{/event}}{{/favorites}}
            </div>
            <div class="account-empty favorites-empty" data-favorites-empty {{#hasFavorites}}hidden{{/hasFavorites}}><span class="account-empty-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h2>아직 좋아요한 행사가 없어요.</h2><p>행사 카드의 하트를 눌러 관심 있는 행사를 모아보세요.</p><a class="account-button account-button--secondary" href="/events/list">행사 둘러보기</a></div>
            <noscript><p class="account-description">좋아요를 변경하려면 JavaScript를 활성화해주세요.</p></noscript>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
{{> layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>
